---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const description = 'Practice coding, system design, behavioral questions, and other interview formats across 51 companies.';
---

<Base title="Interview Notebook" description={description}>
  <article class="container page-shell">
    <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">← All projects</a>
    <h1 class="page-title">Interview Notebook.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">{description}</p>
    <a class="button primary" href="/projects/interview-notebook/lab/">Open Interview Notebook →</a>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="practice-bank">
      <h2 id="practice-bank">The practice bank</h2>
      <p>Choose a company and interview category, or save a shortlist of companies in this browser. The tracker includes 425 exercises with follow-up questions and scoring guides. Each company has two independent exercises in each of four categories. Another 17 exercises draw on published employer examples.</p>
      <p>Open coding problems and company lists from the tracker. Find titles lets you search the broader liquidslr directory and open the FAANG guide or Leetcode Wizard. PracHub also covers system design, behavioral, and specialty practice. Use Practice to search titles and switch between variants. Export a coverage snapshot or a Codex alert from the tracker. Titles you add are stored in this browser.</p>
      <p>The original Airbnb preparation page cited by two exercises is currently unavailable.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
